NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000061 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000062 "=head2 is_exact"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000063 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000064 "Usage: is_exact($strdec) => bool"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000065 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000066 "Test that a decimal number (a string) can be represented exactly as a floating"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000067 "point number."
